{"version":1,"content":"<p>一連兩場的「側田 2026《再一起 COME TOGETHER》－萬聖節香港站」戶外露天音樂會，昨晚（30日）於西九文化區安盛竹翠公園揭開序幕。</p><p>這場演出是側田首次在香港舉行的個人戶外露天音樂會，亦是他一直期待以久的演出形式；</p><p>全場6000座位爆滿，海旁空地由音樂會現場，變身大型戶外Disco，歌迷由頭唱到尾，氣氛熾熱。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.111267+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T12:27:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.063488+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.063488+00:00","content_hash":"d33a426ee896e14bc748e34ca361822f6863d34b2d6f3179a170badbec4eac4f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}